WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.870
You always find the perfect words for a hard conversation.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.210
Usually in the car, after it ended.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:12.610
That's because you rehearsed it in your head, where everyone agrees with you.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:19.110
But the real customer brings up issues or difficult questions in the first sentence, and your plan is gone.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:27.130
So in this adventure, AI helps you get ready, for internal hard conversations and for external critical meetings.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.930
It helps you understand the setup the conversation starts from:

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:37.810
the facts, your goal, the other side's view, and whether your HR partner or manager should be involved first.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:43.610
Then AI helps you simulate the actual conversation, with feedback after each run.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.630
Which means it gets you ready before, simulates the during, and shows you what to do after.
